OL,3,AChannel 4 admits it doesn't know number
OL,4,Aof Married At First Sight UK sex abuse
OL,5,Acomplaints
OL,6,
OL,7,FChannel 4's chief executive has
OL,8,Fadmitted she doesn't know how many
OL,9,Fcomplaints of sexual misconduct were
OL,10,Freceived about Married at First Sight
OL,11,FUK, despite a six-month external review
OL,12,Finto the hit TV show.
OL,14,FWhen asked by MPs, Priya Dogra said:
OL,15,F"I'm not sure I have the details,"
OL,16,Fadding that the review looked
OL,17,Fspecifically at the claims of three
OL,18,Fwomen featured in a BBC Panorama.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
