OL,3,AJensen Huang says he would be
OL,4,A'honoured' to return as Nvidia CEO if
OL,5,Aboard asked him
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said he had an "outpouring" of calls
OL,8,Ffrom company employees, investors and
OL,9,Fothers calling for him to return as CEO
OL,10,Fof Nvidia.
OL,12,FBut, as the BBC reported on Monday,
OL,13,FNvidia's board is not considering
OL,14,Fbringing him back to lead the company.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
